script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Kelvin
	"그래...\n이제 떠날 시간이야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Hope
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = YoungGeo
	"조심히 다녀오세요, 아빠!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Kelvin
	"아카네...\n스바루처럼 웃으며 배웅해 주면"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"좋겠는데."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Hope
	"네 말이 맞아.\n미안해."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"네가 우주에 가는 건\n언제나 꿈꿔 오던 일이었지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"정말 기뻐."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Kelvin
	"고마워, 여보."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = YoungGeo
	"아빠!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"돌아오면 우주 이야기를\n전부 들려주실 거죠!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Kelvin
	"물론이지! 하지만 내가 없는 동안\n착한 아이로 지내야 해!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Hope
	"다이고..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"부디...\n그곳에서도 조심해."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Kelvin
	"그럴게, 약속할게."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"내가 가족을\n절대 외롭게 두진 않을 거야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"스바루...\n내가 없는 동안 엄마를\n잘 부탁한다, 알겠지!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = YoungGeo
	"알겠어요!\n저한테 맡겨 주세요!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"목숨을 걸고 지킬게요!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
