script 4 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Kelvin
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"(무슨 일이 생겨도\n 스바루는 곁에 있을 거야...)"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"(스바루가 아카네를 지켜 줄\n거야.)"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"(스바루라면 유대의 소중함을\n널리 알리려는 내 꿈을\n이어 가 줄 거라고 믿어.)"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"(."
	wait10
	"."
	wait10
	"."
	wait10
	"와, 내가 이런 말을 하다니\n정말 나답지 않네...)"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"(꼭 집에 돌아갈게...)"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"(그리고 언제나처럼 가족을\n두 팔로 꼭 안아 줄 거야.)"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"(그다음엔 아카네가 만든 특별한\n미트로프와 그린빈을 먹고.)"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"(우주에서 지낸 이야기를\n스바루에게 들려줘야지.)"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"(이야, 난 세상에서 제일\n운 좋은 남자야!)"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
